  <name>MRD126-REV1 — Bedrock Geology With Lowlands</name>
  <description>Ontario Geological Survey 2011. 1:250 000 scale bedrock geology of Ontario; Miscellaneous Release—Data 126-Revision 1. Compilation scale 1:250 000. Simplified source descriptor from the supplied MRD126-REV1 doc.kml; only its With Lowlands polygon branch is retained. The application loads the generated local mrd126-cache/manifest.json, not this remote NetworkLink. NetworkLink Regions must never select cache tiles; use actual polygon geometry bounds.</description>
